      "text": {
        "en": "Clients emphasize that the veterinary staff treat community cats and pet dogs with patience and genuine care. Reviewers appreciate that clinicians handle nervous animals gently during intake and ensure comfort before and after surgical procedures. Pet owners frequently express gratitude that both adopted pets and neighborhood stray animals receive kind, respectful treatment."
