      "title": {
        "en": "Welcoming clinic staff and technicians"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners regularly commend the clinic staff, veterinarians, and surgical technicians for their kindness and informative post-operative discharge instructions. Clients value that technicians patiently explain medication dosages and answer recovery questions. A couple of reviewers cited indifferent front desk interactions, but overall feedback strongly commends the clinic team."
      }
    },
    {
