      "title": {
        "en": "Dependable spay and neuter procedures"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers report smooth, complication-free outcomes for spay, neuter, and trap-neuter-return procedures. Clients highlight clean surgical incisions, quick recovery times, and included services such as microchipping and complimentary nail trims. While one client noted a complex surgical recovery, the broad consensus highlights reliable, life-saving preventative care."
      }
    }
